### 1. Listar serviços (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/servicos

### 2. Criar agendamento (201). Repetir a chamada gera 409.
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{"horario":"09:00"}

### 3. Entrada inválida (400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{"horario":"99:00"}

### 4. Falha controlada (500)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/demo/erro
